/span> to complete each sentence.</span>", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 10, "type": "MT1"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "type": "RSLT"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "enpe7n2le02ob09re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Let's define plug \u2013ins!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "You're done!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 12, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "enpe7n2le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "<strong>Customer:</strong> Hello!</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> Hi! Why are you here today? How may I help you?</br>\n<strong>Customer:</strong> I had a problem yesterday when I got home and tried to use my new computer. Whenever I opened the web browser, tons of advertisement appeared and it made the computer kind of slow. I would like to avoid that situation from happening again.</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> Hmm, tell me, did you install any advertisement blocker plug-in?</br>\n<strong>Customer:</strong> A what?</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> A plug-in, ma'am. </br>\n<strong>Customer:</strong> No I didn't. Was it included in the computer box?</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> No, it wasn't. Because a plug-in is not a physical object.</br>", "image": "enpe7n2le02ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 0}, {"time": "37000", "text": "<strong>Customer:</strong> Then, what are they?</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> Well, many computer applications, like web browsers, let third party developers write little programs that add different functions to them. Their name comes from the way they connect to the main program.  </br>\n<strong>Customer:</strong> Why are they so important? Do they have any special function?</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> There are some plug-ins that let users personalize their accounts on some social networks; increasing the number of potential users, and for your particular case, there are plug-ins that work as filters blocking advertisement from any web page.</br>", "image": "enpe7n2le02ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 1}, {"time": "70000", "text": "<strong>Customer:</strong> Tell me more about those plug-ins, please.</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> Sure! Did you know some plug-ins are essential if you want? Well, depending on the kind of web page you want to have, you can choose different plug-ins to add some specific features to your website.</br>\nMaybe you didn't notice, but you use plug-ins all time; one of the most common allows the browser application to run Java applets.</br>\n<strong>Customer:</strong> Well, I didn't install a blocking plug-in, so that's why my computer was really slow. I got it, I will install the advertisement blocking plug-in as soon as I get home. And maybe I will check for other plug-ins that can be useful for me.</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> Was the information useful to you ?</br>\n<strong>Customer:</strong> Totally, thank you so much.</br>\n<strong>Representative:</strong> You're very welcome.", "image": "enpe7n2le02ob09re2img03.jpg", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n2le02ob09re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}